OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with bright spells. Becoming
OL,7,Fcloudy over northeast Aberdeenshire
OL,8,Fwith a few light showers. Dry with
OL,9,Fclear spells and rather chilly in the
OL,10,Fsouthwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA chilly start then a mainly
OL,13,Fdry and bright day. Just the odd light
OL,14,Fshower possible, mainly in the north.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,17,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,18,FSunday. Dry with long sunny spells on
OL,19,FMonday and becoming a little warmer.
OL,20,FOutbreaks of rain spread north on
OL,21,FTuesday.
